  "fixes": [
    "Reflowed mobile main-menu actions and social controls; desktop-only Quit hidden on mobile and controller hints shown only for active controller input.",
    "Enlarged mobile Return and settings controls, paginated settings and controller bindings, and separated touch placement from settings cards.",
    "Preserved gameplay space with size-aware touch placement; aligned coin/skip HUD transforms and constrained large balances to their reserved HUD area.",
    "Unified touch/background pause cleanup; restored the touch Resume control after hardware-keyboard Escape closes pause settings.",
    "Moved mobile credits and the proportionally enlarged optional ad control clear of Return; hid the optional FPS counter in mobile menus and pause."
  ],
